        instruction = "Self-Destruct is triggered as a counter-measure if Incensed Pineapple HP drops too fast, preventing massive zergs or conduit strats. In fact, a SMN conduiting the NM right from the start will eventually trigger Self-Destruction pretty early in the burn, while a controlled low-medium DPS will have little to no problem in this fight.",
