        depth = 3,
        instruction = "While Self-Destruct is more related to how fast the NM dies, keeping it dispelled is essential because it has very high magic attack, dropping almost 90% of Amchuchu's HP in a single Fire V, what would be expected in high Lv NM in game, and not a quest NM. That's a hint that you need to keep it dispelled so the NM will constantly recast Blaze-Spike and Berserk, making it pretty much harmless in terms of danger.",
